# Shared by the live logins (_login_live: the station scenarios, slot 0; _login_space: the space ones, slot 1): the
# login against a live server (e2e.py run --live: the local Net-7 server, account admin / admin) up to character
# select. Not run on its own. Events are the live antprox's lines, named by e2e.py (name_live): 'received NAME' the
# client's, 'sent NAME' the server's.
messages: on
wait-event msg 'Server initialized & ready to go' within 60
click 640,512 until antprox 'Global connection #1' every 0.5 within 120
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 20
click gadget login.username
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 20
click gadget login.username
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 20
